(7737349, 1275612, 30861, '<td valign="top">Being that this is archival, I''d love to know how old those two are now :-) Thanks for the twinny smiles. Back i CA I was married to an identical twin for quite a while :-)</td>', 'Being that this is archival, I''d love to know how old those two are now :-) Thanks for the twinny smiles. Back i CA I was married to an identical twin for quite a while :-)', '2023-01-27 13:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
