(7737355, 1275551, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not-quite-a-bear, my spirit-cousin Koala leads the world in how to snuggle in trees. At the San Diego Zoo we had the first batch of Koalas in America so I grew up enjoying them. I''ve even had a baby in my hands. It''s a pity they''re not as friendly as they look: snarky little critters when they''re all grown up...</td>', 'Not-quite-a-bear, my spirit-cousin Koala leads the world in how to snuggle in trees. At the San Diego Zoo we had the first batch of Koalas in America so I grew up enjoying them. I''ve even had a baby in my hands. It''s a pity they''re not as friendly as they look: snarky little critters when they''re all grown up...', '2023-01-27 13:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737356, 1275697, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a bear-and-a-half. Looks like it could be a Grizzly, probably not a Kodiak, which is what I am, but a very close cousin... But, sadly, I don''t know my bears that well... Lovely animal.</td>', 'That''s a bear-and-a-half. Looks like it could be a Grizzly, probably not a Kodiak, which is what I am, but a very close cousin... But, sadly, I don''t know my bears that well... Lovely animal.', '2023-01-27 14:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
