(7737361, 1275679, 124815, '<td valign="top">There is no mark available for an image like this one. Humanity at its best expression. Far beyond photo quality or such nonsense. An powerful and intelligent understanding of life and beyond. <br/>"Human speech is like a cracked kettle on which we tap crude rhythms for bears to dance to, while we long to make music that will melt the stars."<br/> <br/>It will be very hard to continue marking other images in this challenge.</td>', 'There is no mark available for an image like this one. Humanity at its best expression. Far beyond photo quality or such nonsense. An powerful and intelligent understanding of life and beyond. "Human speech is like a cracked kettle on which we tap crude rhythms for bears to dance to, while we long to make music that will melt the stars." It will be very hard to continue marking other images in this challenge.', '2023-01-27 14:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
